이미 아시겠지만, 어제 테크
리포트로 Attention
And as you probably already know, we released our new architecture yesterday in our tech report — it's called Attention Residual.

389
00:30:49,408 --> 00:30:54,240
Residual이라는 새
아키텍처를 공개했습니다.

