00:31:46,880 --> 00:31:53,320
신경망의 깊이, 즉 레이어 수를
늘리면 아무도 학습시킬 수 없었습니다.
If you increase the depth, if you increase the number of layers for neural networks, nobody was able to train it,

401
00:31:53,320 --> 00:31:59,280
그래디언트 폭발과 소실 같은 온갖
안정성 문제가 나타났기 때문입니다.
because you would observe this gradient explosion, gradient vanishing — all these stability issues.

402
00:31:59,280 --> 00:32:02,590
하지만 ResNet 등장 이후에는 레이어
But then, after the introduction of ResNet, we can train an arbitrarily large number of layers.

