00:32:28,320 --> 00:32:32,480
LSTM은 순환
신경망(RNN)의 한 변형입니다.
If you look at LSTM, it is a variant of a recurrent net, right?

409
00:32:32,480 --> 00:32:36,000
즉 순환적인 모델링 과정입니다.
And it's a recurrent modeling process.

410
00:32:36,000 --> 00:32:41,120
직전 스텝의 히든 스테이트를 가져온 다음
So we're going to take the hidden states from the last step,

411
00:32:41,120 --> 00:32:47,600
게이팅 메커니즘 같은 함수를
거쳐 현재 상태를 만들어냅니다.
and then we're going to have some gating mechanism, some function, to produce the current state, right?

